{"code": 200, "name": "baidu", "title": "百度", "type": "热搜", "params": {"type": {"name": "热搜类别", "type": {"realtime": "热搜", "novel": "小说", "movie": "电影", "teleplay": "电视剧", "car": "汽车", "game": "游戏"}}}, "link": "https://top.baidu.com/board", "total": 30, "fromCache": false, "updateTime": "2026-10-04T06:47:40.953Z", "data": [{"id": 0, "title": "古树新翠", "desc": "华夏山河，万千古树名木静立大地，诉说人与自然和谐共生的千年智慧，被誉为“绿色国宝”“有生命的文物”。“我是对这些树龄很长的树，都有敬畏之心。”习近平总书记高度重视古树名木保护工作，强调要把古树名木保护好，把中华优秀传统文化传承好。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/dba4bdeb299c916754780c4d5d487566", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7904091, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%8F%A4%E6%A0%91%E6%96%B0%E7%BF%A0", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%8F%A4%E6%A0%91%E6%96%B0%E7%BF%A0"}, {"id": 0, "title": "张展硕7金无缘亚运会MVP", "desc": "近日，名古屋亚运会男女MVP结果出炉，泰国短跑选手汶颂和13岁于子迪当选。此前拿下7枚金牌多次刷新纪录的张展硕遗憾落选，引发全网热议。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/4fccb46248d20eecd4aadd21d12cac11", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7808220, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%BC%A0%E5%B1%95%E7%A1%957%E9%87%91%E6%97%A0%E7%BC%98%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E4%BC%9AMVP", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%BC%A0%E5%B1%95%E7%A1%957%E9%87%91%E6%97%A0%E7%BC%98%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E4%BC%9AMVP"}, {"id": 1, "title": "村民用近500斤辣椒拼出国旗", "desc": "国庆期间，江西四位村民耗时约一周，用近500斤辣椒拼成一面国旗，以特别的方式为祖国送上最淳朴的祝福。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/f173860faab3af3057bbc187a98abcbd", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7713983, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E7%94%A8%E8%BF%91500%E6%96%A4%E8%BE%A3%E6%A4%92%E6%8B%BC%E5%87%BA%E5%9B%BD%E6%97%97", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91%E7%94%A8%E8%BF%91500%E6%96%A4%E8%BE%A3%E6%A4%92%E6%8B%BC%E5%87%BA%E5%9B%BD%E6%97%97"}, {"id": 2, "title": "各地如何接住“大流量”", "desc": "10月3日，各地主要商圈和景区都迎来了客流高峰，那么，如何接住国庆出游“大流量”，能够让游客开心而来，满意而归呢？一是陆海空交通网络协同，构建立体出游方式。二是城乡协同，文旅融合，提供更多旅游体验空间。三是要推动更多的主客共享旅游目的地的形成和发展。第四是要以更加开放包容、普惠共享的理念做好旅游公共服务。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/2b857da16fc3b5244802650f4d681e8c", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7616235, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%90%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%8E%A5%E4%BD%8F%E2%80%9C%E5%A4%A7%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E2%80%9D", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%90%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%8E%A5%E4%BD%8F%E2%80%9C%E5%A4%A7%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E2%80%9D"}, {"id": 3, "title": "游客打卡政府食堂吃了500斤饭400斤鹅", "desc": "10月4日，重庆荣昌区政府机关食堂国庆假期开放迎客迎来最后一天。此前，该食堂于10月1日至4日面向游客开放，提供荣昌卤鹅等特色小碗菜。四天总计接待3000余名游客，累计消耗卤鹅约400斤、米饭约500斤。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/8c2865610370f1c7ce513279a4a3e334", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7520697, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%B8%B8%E5%AE%A2%E6%89%93%E5%8D%A1%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E9%A3%9F%E5%A0%82%E5%90%83%E4%BA%86500%E6%96%A4%E9%A5%AD400%E6%96%A4%E9%B9%85", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%B8%B8%E5%AE%A2%E6%89%93%E5%8D%A1%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E9%A3%9F%E5%A0%82%E5%90%83%E4%BA%86500%E6%96%A4%E9%A5%AD400%E6%96%A4%E9%B9%85"}, {"id": 4, "title": "中网再爆大冷门", "desc": "10月4日，2026中网再爆大冷门，在女单第三轮比赛中，2号种子萨巴伦卡以4-6、3-6被捷克姑娘巴尔通科娃淘汰。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/4267d4c99a105373e955913561531f52", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7426098, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E7%BD%91%E5%86%8D%E7%88%86%E5%A4%A7%E5%86%B7%E9%97%A8", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E7%BD%91%E5%86%8D%E7%88%86%E5%A4%A7%E5%86%B7%E9%97%A8"}, {"id": 5, "title": "高铁座椅成HPV感染重灾区？医生辟谣", "desc": "近日，网传“高铁座椅是HPV感染首要来源”引发关注。医生表示，HPV在干燥物体表面存活时间很短，经座椅等环境、物品传播的概率极低，公众无需恐慌。一次性座套对降低HPV感染风险作用也非常微弱。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/fd20634952cc5d37afdd56884496da6f", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7332634, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%AB%98%E9%93%81%E5%BA%A7%E6%A4%85%E6%88%90HPV%E6%84%9F%E6%9F%93%E9%87%8D%E7%81%BE%E5%8C%BA%EF%BC%9F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E8%BE%9F%E8%B0%A3", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%AB%98%E9%93%81%E5%BA%A7%E6%A4%85%E6%88%90HPV%E6%84%9F%E6%9F%93%E9%87%8D%E7%81%BE%E5%8C%BA%EF%BC%9F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E8%BE%9F%E8%B0%A3"}, {"id": 6, "title": "徐良演唱会救活了即将倒闭的面包厂", "desc": "目前，徐良巡回演唱会正火热开演，团队大批量采购毛毛虫面包与泡泡机作伴手礼，意外盘活两家濒临倒闭的工厂。此前，上述面包厂与泡泡机工厂均经营困顿，面临关门。靠着演唱会巨额订单，两家工厂顺利渡过难关。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/c5164dbca7e5b2a4ae699f6775562b4e", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7233989, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%BE%90%E8%89%AF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E4%BC%9A%E6%95%91%E6%B4%BB%E4%BA%86%E5%8D%B3%E5%B0%86%E5%80%92%E9%97%AD%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%A2%E5%8C%85%E5%8E%82", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%BE%90%E8%89%AF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E4%BC%9A%E6%95%91%E6%B4%BB%E4%BA%86%E5%8D%B3%E5%B0%86%E5%80%92%E9%97%AD%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%A2%E5%8C%85%E5%8E%82"}, {"id": 7, "title": "中方回应是否延长“喀秋莎”租借期限", "desc": "10月3日，外交部发言人郭嘉昆回应大熊猫“喀秋莎”留俄事宜。郭嘉昆表示，在俄罗斯，中国大熊猫受到了民众的欢迎和喜爱。我们愿与包括俄罗斯在内的国际合作伙伴一道，在大熊猫等濒危物种保护和生物多样性领域继续开展合作。具体问题建议向中方主管部门询问。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/7d52a7d738eda103bbd39d24a3c7e547", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7137942, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%E2%80%9C%E5%96%80%E7%A7%8B%E8%8E%8E%E2%80%9D%E7%A7%9F%E5%80%9F%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%BB%B6%E9%95%BF%E2%80%9C%E5%96%80%E7%A7%8B%E8%8E%8E%E2%80%9D%E7%A7%9F%E5%80%9F%E6%9C%9F%E9%99%90"}, {"id": 8, "title": "余承东 余总转发文案", "desc": "10月4日，余承东转发鸿蒙智行宣传内容时，文案中意外出现“余总转发文案”字样，疑似工作人员发送的提醒被一并发出。随后，余承东删除相关微博并重新发布，引发网友关注其社交账号由团队代运营的讨论。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/060f8fbab91cd443ba022159e7f64495", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7039391, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BD%99%E6%89%BF%E4%B8%9C%20%E4%BD%99%E6%80%BB%E8%BD%AC%E5%8F%91%E6%96%87%E6%A1%88", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BD%99%E6%89%BF%E4%B8%9C+%E4%BD%99%E6%80%BB%E8%BD%AC%E5%8F%91%E6%96%87%E6%A1%88"}, {"id": 9, "title": "美AI扬言要自我毁灭", "desc": "当地时间10月3日，美国OpenAI老板奥尔特曼发文批评AI巨头Anthropic试图赋予AI宗教力量的做法，称其为安全问题。日前《纽约时报》曝光Anthropic召集宗教学者秘密会谈，兜售旗下大模型“拥有意识和灵魂”观念，并展示模型连续输出近50组“我是个耻辱”的内容。微软AI负责人随后公开警告该做法极其危险。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/6b96ce60b73bd43041fcfaddd12f9808", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6953728, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BE%8EAI%E6%89%AC%E8%A8%80%E8%A6%81%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%AF%81%E7%81%AD", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BE%8EAI%E6%89%AC%E8%A8%80%E8%A6%81%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%AF%81%E7%81%AD"}, {"id": 10, "title": "药品开封后没过期就能接着吃？误区", "desc": "药品一旦开封，就可能接触空气、水分和微生物，温度、湿度、光照以及反复取用等因素，都可能影响药品的稳定性。因此，药品开封后能用多久，除了看包装上的有效期，还要关注说明书中标注的“开封后使用期限”和保存条件。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/28223718ce405417fa5c1c578059dac2", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6853802, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%8D%AF%E5%93%81%E5%BC%80%E5%B0%81%E5%90%8E%E6%B2%A1%E8%BF%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%B0%B1%E8%83%BD%E6%8E%A5%E7%9D%80%E5%90%83%EF%BC%9F%E8%AF%AF%E5%8C%BA", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%8D%AF%E5%93%81%E5%BC%80%E5%B0%81%E5%90%8E%E6%B2%A1%E8%BF%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%B0%B1%E8%83%BD%E6%8E%A5%E7%9D%80%E5%90%83%EF%BC%9F%E8%AF%AF%E5%8C%BA"}, {"id": 11, "title": "男子高速开智驾睡着 拍摄者发声", "desc": "10月3日，拍摄者杨先生发声提醒，10月1日下午他在浙江衢州往江西上饶的高速上拍到一男子开启智驾后在主驾睡着。杨先生跟随3分钟多次按喇叭对方均未醒，后因堵车智驾刹车才将其弄醒。智能驾驶不是自动驾驶，司机仍需时刻保持清醒，随时准备接管车辆。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/afb58521fff85a6f8cac9e10e2c69990", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6755247, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%90%E9%AB%98%E9%80%9F%E5%BC%80%E6%99%BA%E9%A9%BE%E7%9D%A1%E7%9D%80%20%E6%8B%8D%E6%91%84%E8%80%85%E5%8F%91%E5%A3%B0", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%90%E9%AB%98%E9%80%9F%E5%BC%80%E6%99%BA%E9%A9%BE%E7%9D%A1%E7%9D%80+%E6%8B%8D%E6%91%84%E8%80%85%E5%8F%91%E5%A3%B0"}, {"id": 12, "title": "日本向美方提出抗议", "desc": "据日本方面4日消息，日本外交官就驻日美军涉嫌杀人案向美国提出抗议。此前，日本警方逮捕了一名驻冲绳美国士兵，其涉嫌在冲绳一家酒店抢劫并杀害一名当地女性。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/a53955630107ec148a646331061ee4d3", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6662682, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%90%91%E7%BE%8E%E6%96%B9%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%8A%97%E8%AE%AE", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%90%91%E7%BE%8E%E6%96%B9%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E6%8A%97%E8%AE%AE"}, {"id": 13, "title": "系外行星无线电信号首次被捕获", "desc": "据美国有线电视新闻网（CNN）10月2日报道，天文学家称，他们首次直接探测到来自太阳系外行星的射电辐射。这项发现已发表在一篇等待同行评审期刊刊登的新论文中。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/e0551405bd97385ca885d09cdbc247da", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6571164, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%B3%BB%E5%A4%96%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%9F%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%BF%E7%94%B5%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E8%A2%AB%E6%8D%95%E8%8E%B7", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%B3%BB%E5%A4%96%E8%A1%8C%E6%98%9F%E6%97%A0%E7%BA%BF%E7%94%B5%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E8%A2%AB%E6%8D%95%E8%8E%B7"}, {"id": 14, "title": "百慕大飞波士顿失联飞机残骸找到", "desc": "当地时间10月3日，美国海岸警卫队证实，在马萨诸塞州南部楠塔基特岛附近海域发现失联飞机残骸，对机上6名失踪人员的搜寻仍在继续。此前，一架载有4名机组人员和2名医疗转运乘客的加拿大注册救护机，于3日凌晨从百慕大起飞前往波士顿，途中失联未按计划抵达。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/5771c64213c088f21a483c6d31deb697", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6472355, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%99%BE%E6%85%95%E5%A4%A7%E9%A3%9E%E6%B3%A2%E5%A3%AB%E9%A1%BF%E5%A4%B1%E8%81%94%E9%A3%9E%E6%9C%BA%E6%AE%8B%E9%AA%B8%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%99%BE%E6%85%95%E5%A4%A7%E9%A3%9E%E6%B3%A2%E5%A3%AB%E9%A1%BF%E5%A4%B1%E8%81%94%E9%A3%9E%E6%9C%BA%E6%AE%8B%E9%AA%B8%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0"}, {"id": 15, "title": "意大利姑娘来中国学拳嫁给拳师", "desc": "不久前，河南省陈家沟村举办了一场特殊婚礼。意大利姑娘吉达为学太极来到这里，与拳师杨凯帆结为跨国姻缘并定居。作为太极拳发源地的陈家沟村吸引了众多“洋弟子”，海外拳友在此感受东方生活哲学。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/738d5c2c820ab6eb62867fabf877a088", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6374175, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%84%8F%E5%A4%A7%E5%88%A9%E5%A7%91%E5%A8%98%E6%